<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F8.sf6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(f)</span> </span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 8</span>: </span><span id="S4.F8.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The scenario generated by different user descriptions, Fig. <a href="#S4.F8.sf1" title="In Fig. 8 ‣ IV-B3 Interactive Scenarios Generation ‣ IV-B Scenario Generation with Different Criticality ‣ IV Experiments ‣ LinguaSim: Interactive Multi-Vehicle Testing Scenario Generation via Natural Language Instruction Based on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8(a)</span></a>, <a href="#S4.F8.sf2" title="In Fig. 8 ‣ IV-B3 Interactive Scenarios Generation ‣ IV-B Scenario Generation with Different Criticality ‣ IV Experiments ‣ LinguaSim: Interactive Multi-Vehicle Testing Scenario Generation via Natural Language Instruction Based on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8(b)</span></a>, <a href="#S4.F8.sf3" title="In Fig. 8 ‣ IV-B3 Interactive Scenarios Generation ‣ IV-B Scenario Generation with Different Criticality ‣ IV Experiments ‣ LinguaSim: Interactive Multi-Vehicle Testing Scenario Generation via Natural Language Instruction Based on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8(c)</span></a> represent one of the scenario generated based on <span id="S4.F8.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Dangerous Description</span>, where Fig. <a href="#S4.F8.sf2" title="In Fig. 8 ‣ IV-B3 Interactive Scenarios Generation ‣ IV-B Scenario Generation with Different Criticality ‣ IV Experiments ‣ LinguaSim: Interactive Multi-Vehicle Testing Scenario Generation via Natural Language Instruction Based on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8(b)</span></a>, <a href="#S4.F8.sf3" title="In Fig. 8 ‣ IV-B3 Interactive Scenarios Generation ‣ IV-B Scenario Generation with Different Criticality ‣ IV Experiments ‣ LinguaSim: Interactive Multi-Vehicle Testing Scenario Generation via Natural Language Instruction Based on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8(c)</span></a> show that the truck forces a cut-in, causing the ego vehicle to perform a sudden brake, eventually lead to a collision between the ego vehicle and the sedan behind it. Fig. <a href="#S4.F8.sf4" title="In Fig. 8 ‣ IV-B3 Interactive Scenarios Generation ‣ IV-B Scenario Generation with Different Criticality ‣ IV Experiments ‣ LinguaSim: Interactive Multi-Vehicle Testing Scenario Generation via Natural Language Instruction Based on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8(d)</span></a>, <a href="#S4.F8.sf5" title="In Fig. 8 ‣ IV-B3 Interactive Scenarios Generation ‣ IV-B Scenario Generation with Different Criticality ‣ IV Experiments ‣ LinguaSim: Interactive Multi-Vehicle Testing Scenario Generation via Natural Language Instruction Based on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8(e)</span></a>, <a href="#S4.F8.sf6" title="In Fig. 8 ‣ IV-B3 Interactive Scenarios Generation ‣ IV-B Scenario Generation with Different Criticality ‣ IV Experiments ‣ LinguaSim: Interactive Multi-Vehicle Testing Scenario Generation via Natural Language Instruction Based on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8(f)</span></a> represent one of the scenario generated based on <span id="S4.F8.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Safe Description</span>, where Fig. <a href="#S4.F8.sf5" title="In Fig. 8 ‣ IV-B3 Interactive Scenarios Generation ‣ IV-B Scenario Generation with Different Criticality ‣ IV Experiments ‣ LinguaSim: Interactive Multi-Vehicle Testing Scenario Generation via Natural Language Instruction Based on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8(e)</span></a> shows that the truck only starts to cut in after a clean overtake, while the sedan follows in a safe distance.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
